', 'answer': 'unsupported'}, 'Firmus investment', \"By December 31, 2026, will NVIDIA have completed its approximately US$500 million investment in Firmus Technologies through preference shares converted into ordinary equity at Firmus's ASX IPO, as confirmed by Firmus's listing documents or NVIDIA's investment disclosures?\")\n('C030', 'F-new-3-Q3', 'fresh', 'yes/no', True, {'worth': 'worth', 'answer': {'split': ['insufficient', 'unsupported']}}, 'China H200 authorization (M15)', \"Will China's government permit imports of Nvidia H200 AI chips into China by NVIDIA's FY2027 year-end on January 31, 2027, as established by Chinese government, regulatory or customs announcements?\")\nfresh numeric bets worth\n5\n('hyperscaler capex 2026 (M04)', [('F-old-1-Q6', {'split': ['unsupported', 'supported']}, 'How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data center capital expenditures in calendar 2026?'), ('F-old-2-Q5', 'supported', 'How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expenditures in calendar 2026?'), ('F-old-3-Q6', 'supported', 'How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expenditures in calendar 2026?')])\n('MediaTek convertible bond', [('F-old-1-Q36', 'supported', 'How much financing will NVIDIA have provided to MediaTek through the announced convertible-bond investment by its FY2027 annual report?'), ('F-old-3-Q42', 'supported', 'At NVIDIA’s FY2027 annual filing, what amount of financing to MediaTek through the agreed convertible-bond investment will NVIDIA report as outstanding or committed?')])\n('H100 rental price', [('F-new-3-Q7', 'supported', \"What will the spot rental price in USD per H100 GPU-hour be on December 31, 2026, as reported in Ornn's compute-marketplace spot-price data?\")])\n('CoreWeave and Nebius capex 2026', [('F-new-3-Q21', {'split': ['supported', 'unsupported']}, 'What will combined calendar-2026 data-centre capital expenditure be for CoreWeave and Nebius, the two named neoclouds used as the fixed reporting cohort, as reported in their full-year earnings releases and annual filings?')])\n('cloud service agreement commitments (M32)', [('F-new-3-Q30', 'supported', 'What total amount of cloud service agreement commitments to AI cloud partners, under arrangements requiring NVIDIA to purchase capacity not sold to third parties, will NVIDIA disclose as outstanding at FY2027 year-end (January 31, 2027) in the commitments note of its FY2027 Form 10-K?')])\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
